<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Greenwich Air upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Greenwich Air upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded Greenwich Air Services Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 22-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
